What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int x = 0;
boolean r = (x++ > 0) && (x++ > 0);
boolean s = (x++ >= 0) || (x++ > 0);
System.out.println(x + " " + r + " " + s);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int a = 4, b = 6, c = 0, d = 0;
if (a > 3)
    if (b > 7)
        c = 1;
    else
        c = 2;
if (a > 5)
    if (b > 7)
        d = 1;
    else
        d = 2;
System.out.println(c + " " + d);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
public static String f(int n) {
    String s = "";
    if (n % 3 == 0) s += "Fizz";
    if (n % 5 == 0) s += "Buzz";
    else s += n;
    return s;
}
```

```java
System.out.println(f(15) + "," + f(10) + "," + f(9));
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int x = 7;
boolean b1 = x > 5 && x < 10 || x == 12 && x > 20;
boolean b2 = x > 5 && (x < 10 || x == 12) && x > 20;
boolean b3 = !(x > 5) || x < 10 && x != 7;
System.out.println(b1 + " " + b2 + " " + b3);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Person {
    private String name;
    private int age;
    public Person(String n, int a) { name = n; age = a; }
    public boolean equals(Object o) {
        if (!(o instanceof Person)) return false;
        Person p = (Person) o;
        return name.equals(p.name);
    }
}
```

```java
Person a = new Person("Ann", 20);
Person b = new Person("Ann", 31);
Person c = a;
Person d = new Person("Bob", 20);
System.out.println(a.equals(b) + " " + (a == b) + " " + (a == c) + " " + a.equals(d) + " " + a.equals("Ann"));
```

