Assume `n` is an `int` variable. For which values of `n` does the following code segment assign "B" to `g`?

```java
String g = "";
if (n >= 90)
    g = "A";
else if (n >= 80)
    g = "B";
if (n >= 70 && n < 80)
    g = "C";
if (n < 70)
    g = "F";
```

Consider the following method.

```java
public static int sign(int n) {
    if (n > 0)
        return 1;
    else if (n < 0)
        return -1;
}
```

