What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int n = 12;
int score = 0;
if (n % 2 == 0) score += 1;
if (n % 3 == 0) score += 2;
else if (n % 4 == 0) score += 4;
if (n % 4 == 0 && n % 6 == 0) score += 8;
if (!(n % 5 == 0) || n > 10) score += 16;
System.out.println(score);
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
String a = "Banana", b = "apple", c = "apple";
System.out.println((a.compareTo(b) < 0) + " " + (b.compareTo(c) == 0) + " " + (b == c) + " " + a.equalsIgnoreCase("BANANA") + " " + (a.toLowerCase().compareTo(b) > 0));
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
public static String g(int x) {
    if (x > 10)
        return "A";
    else if (x >= 10)
        return "B";
    else if (x > 5)
        return "C";
    else
        return "D";
}
```

```java
System.out.println(g(11) + g(10) + g(6) + g(5));
```
